ADDENDA <Presidential Decree No. 24391, Feb. 20, 2013>
Article 1 (Enforcement date)
This Decree shall enter into force on February 23, 2013.
Article 2 (Special cases concerning submission of energy saving plans)
(1) Notwithstanding Article 10(1), "building ... <omitted> ... prescribed by Presidential Decree" in Article 14(1) of the Act means any of the following buildings by August 31, 2013:
1. Apartments and row housing from among multi-family housing;
2. Research institutes from among education and research facilities, business facilities, and other buildings with similar energy use characteristics and state of use, etc., with the total floor area of which is used for the relevant purpose is at least 3,000 square meters;
3. Dormitories, medical facilities, youth hostels from among training facilities, lodging facilities, and other buildings with similar energy use characteristics and state of use, etc., with the total floor area of which is used for the relevant purpose is at least 2,000 square meters;
4. Public baths from among Class 1 neighborhood living facilities, indoor swimming pool from among training facilities, and other buildings with similar energy use characteristics and state of use, etc., with the total floor area of which is used for the relevant purpose is at least 500 square meters;
5. Sales facilities and other buildings with similar energy use characteristics and state of use, etc., with the total floor area of which is used for the relevant purpose is at least 3,000 square meters;
6. Cultural and assembly facilities (excluding zoological and botanical gardens), religious facilities, funeral facilities, education and research facilities (excluding research institutes), and other buildings with similar energy use characteristics and state of use, etc., with the total floor area of which is used for the relevant purpose is at least 10,000 square meters.
(2) A project owner who has submitted an energy saving plan pursuant to the Building Act before this Decree enters into force shall be deemed to have submitted an energy saving plan pursuant to Article 10(2).
Article 3 Omitted.

