Article 1 (Enforcement date)
This Decree shall enter into force on January 1, 2023.
Article 2 (Transitional measures concerning buildings subject to mandatory indication of certification of building energy efficiency rating or certification of zero energy buildings)
Notwithstanding the amended provisions of Appendix 1, the previous provisions shall apply to mandatory indication of the certification of energy efficiency ratings or the certification of zero energy buildings of buildings falling under any of the following subparagraphs:
1. A building for which a building permit under Article 11 of the Building Act (including permission, authorization, approval, etc. under other statutes by which it is deemed that a building permit is granted; hereinafter the same shall apply) has been obtained or filed before this Decree enters into force;
2. A building for which an application for deliberation has been filed with the building committee pursuant to Article 4-2(1) of the Building Act in order to obtain a building permit before this Decree enters into force;
3. A building falling under subparagraph 1, for which an application for permission for modification or report on modification is filed after this Decree enters into force.

