Article 1 (Enforcement date)
This Decree shall enter into force on the date of its promulgation.
Article 2 (Applicability to buildings subject to green building certification)
The amended provisions of subparagraph 1 of Article 11-3 shall begin to apply from housing units for which applications for, report on, or request for approval under the following subparagraphs are filed after this Decree enters into force:
1. An application for a building permit under Article 11 of the Building Act (excluding permission for modification and report on modification under Article 16 of the Building Act) (referring to an application for a building permit and deliberation by the building committee in cases of a building subject to deliberation by the building committee pursuant to Article 4-2(2) of the Building Act);
2. A report on building construction under Article 14 of the Building Act (excluding permission for modification and report on modification under Article 16 of the Building Act);
3. A request for consultation under Article 29 of the Building Act (excluding permission for modification and report on modification under Article 16 of the Building Act);
4. An application for, or report on permission, authorization, approval, etc. under other statutes for which permission, report, or consultation under subparagraphs 1 through 3 is deemed granted, filed, or completed.

