ADDENDA <Presidential Decree No. 35081, Dec. 17, 2024>
Article 1 (Enforcement date)
This Decree shall enter into force on January 1, 2025.
Article 2 (Transitional measures concerning application of relaxation of floor area ratio requirements to promote development of green buildings)
Notwithstanding the amended provisions of Article 11(1)3, the previous provisions shall apply where an application for certification of building energy efficiency rating is filed pursuant to the previous provisions of Article 17(3) of the Act before this Decree enters into force.
Article 3 (Transitional measures concerning buildings subject to mandatory indication of certification of building energy efficiency rating and certification of zero energy buildings)
Notwithstanding the amended provisions of Article 12(2) and Appendix 1, the previous provisions shall apply to mandatory indication of the certification of energy efficiency ratings or the certification of zero energy buildings of buildings falling under any of the following subparagraphs:
1. Buildings for which building permission has been obtained or applied (including where an application for deliberation of a building committee is filed pursuant to Article 4-2(1) of the same Act to apply for building permission) under Article 11 of the Building Act before this Decree enters into force;
2. Buildings for which a notification of building construction has been filed under Article 14 of the Building Act before this Decree enters into force;
3. Buildings for which consultation under Article 29 of the Building Act has been requested before this Decree enters into force;
4. Buildings which an application for, or report on, permission, authorization, approval, etc. under other statutes for which permission, report, or consultation under subparagraphs 1 through 3 is deemed granted, filed, or completed before this Decree enters into force;
5. Buildings falling under subparagraphs 1 through 4, for which an application for permission for modification or report on modification under Article 16 of the Building Act is filed after this Decree enters into force.
Article 4 Omitted.

